  "decision_summary": "The query molecule is voriconazole, a triazole antifungal known to penetrate the CNS. The provided in vivo evidence from multiple small molecules with similar physicochemical features (fluorophenyl, heteroaromatic, moderate lipophilicity) consistently demonstrates meaningful brain uptake, supporting a pass prediction. Meningitis may further increase BBB permeability.",
